  <description>
    <p>AndBible is a free, open-source Bible study tool for reading and in-depth research, available offline and without ads.</p>
    <p>Compare translations and commentaries in split views, organize studies in workspaces, search documents, and add bookmarks, highlights and notes.</p>
    <p>Explore a library of Bible translations, commentaries, dictionaries and books from SWORD repositories.</p>
  </description>
